From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LECH OS <dev@lech-os.invalid>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Build CarrierConfig2 without the GrapheneOS test activity

LECH OS builds CarrierConfig2 of GrapheneOS on AOSP (task E2-11b): it
loads the carrier settings of the Pixel (/product/etc/CarrierSettings)
for SMS, VoLTE and APNs. Its TestActivity and CmpTest compare the result
with the Google CarrierSettings app through GmsCompat and use framework
APIs that only GrapheneOS has (com.android.internal.gmscompat,
android.ext.PackageId), so the app would not compile on AOSP. Leave the
test activity, its comparison test and its theme out; the carrier
service, the APN service and the vendor config provider are unchanged.
---
 AndroidManifest.xml                           |   8 +-
 res/values/themes.xml                         |   6 -
 .../carrierconfig2/TestActivity.java          | 106 --------
 .../carrierconfig2/loader/CmpTest.java        | 252 ------------------
 4 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 370 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 res/values/themes.xml
 delete mode 100644 src/app/grapheneos/carrierconfig2/TestActivity.java
 delete mode 100644 src/app/grapheneos/carrierconfig2/loader/CmpTest.java

